    narr:narration """This narrative holds two positions in tension. The hub is defined against [real-time chat as the named anti-pattern](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat) — the product explicitly frames itself as not-Slack/[Teams](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). Yet the [next-sprint focus on context preservation](narr:Position_ContextPreservationNextSprint) pulls toward the same territory: linking decisions to the discussion threads that produced them, the #[1](narr:Position_ContextPreservationNextSprint) beta-user request. The story so far is a boundary-drawing exercise whose first concrete move reaches into the category it rejects.""" ;
